# "Whenever YOU cast your second spell each turn": Bot2 casts two spells on its own turn 2, its second Mox included,
# and Zenith (Bot1's, on the battlefield since turn 1) does nothing. Then on turn 3 Bot1 casts two spells, a positive
# control with the same count, and the trigger fires: spells are counted for each player afresh each turn.

